{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31094","headline":"蒙恩除侍御史行次华州寄蒋相 · 薛能","name":"蒙恩除侍御史行次华州寄蒋相","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林下天书起遁逃，不堪移疾入尘劳。\n黄河近岸阴风急，仙掌临关旭日高。\n行野衆喧闻鴈发，宿亭孤寂有狼嗥。\n荀家位极兼禅理，应笑埋轮着所操。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}